Package: meo-3
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/thingai/meo-3
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), libgcc-s1, adduser, systemd, mosquitto, npm, nodejs (>= 22.9), openjdk-@JAVA_REQ@-jre-headless | java@JAVA_REQ@-runtime-headless
Description: MEO 3 gateway (Make Everything Online)
 Local-first IoT platform for STEAM education. Installs the MEO gateway
 service, the BLE provisioning service, and the MEO build of Node-RED, and
 runs all three under systemd.
 .
 Node.js 22.9 or newer is required; Debian and Raspberry Pi OS stable ship an
 older version, so add the NodeSource repository before installing. The Java
 dependency matches the JDK the service was built with; Debian 12 and Raspberry
 Pi OS Bookworm only offer openjdk-17.
